{"slug":"itai-no-wa-iya-nano-de-bougyoryoku-ni-kyokufuri-shitai-to-omoimasu","ad":"Itai no wa Iya nano de Bougyoryoku ni Kyokufuri Shitai to Omoimasu.","adEn":"Itai no wa Iya nanode Bougyoryoku ni Kyokufuri Shitai to Omoimasu.","yil":2020,"puan":73,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"WINTER","sure":23,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1579/113812.jpg","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106479-G1rExJ4m8Be3.jpg","banner4k":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/75iXyfHsSz22kIyVZBNa2Pok0dU.jpg","banner4kGenislik":3840,"ozet":"The story centers on Kaede Honjou, who is invited by her friend Risa Shiramine to play a virtual reality MMO game with her. While Kaede doesn't dislike games, what she really, truly dislikes is being in pain. She creates a character named Maple, and decides to put all her points in VIT to minimize pain. As a result, she moves slowly, can't use magic, and even a rabbit can get the best of her. However, as it turns out, she acquires a skill known as \"Absolute Defense\" as a result of her pumping points into VIT, as well as a \"Counter Skill\" that works against special moves. Now, with her ability to nullify all damage, she goes on adventures.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network, edited)","turler":["Aksiyon","Macera","Komedi","Fantastik","Günlük Yaşam","Isekai","Video Oyunları","Kadın Başrol"],"iliski":[{"t":"SEQUEL","s":"itai-no-wa-iya-nano-de-bougyoryoku-ni-kyokufuri-shitai-to-omoimasu-2","ad":"BOFURI: I Don't Want to Get Hurt, so I'll Max Out My Defense. Season 2","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116867-bXUSi1BWrd9R.jpg","f":"TV"}],"seri":"itai-no-wa-iya-nano-de-bougyoryoku-ni-kyokufuri-shitai-to-omoimasu","fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"2ji-cLcT-UI"},"yasal":[{"a":"Hulu","u":"https://www.hulu.com/bofuri-i-dont-want-to-get-hurt-so-ill-max-out-my-defense"},{"a":"YouTube","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl0fxMZfFjcKLnL0Hj6cw3Op"},{"a":"Netfl